## Measured on the rendered file

- 1024x576 H.264 High, 24 fps, 15800 frames; AAC 48 kHz stereo; 658.333 s. ffmpeg full decode reported 0 errors.
- Shot placement: for each of the 126 picture shots I compared the cut's first, middle and last frame of the slot with the supplied shot's frames 0, middle and last (grey, 256x144). PSNR was 47.5 dB or more on all of them, which is encode loss. Every shot's frame count equals its timeline `frames`.
- Sync: I cross-correlated 4 s of the cut's audio against `mix.wav` at 30, 300 and 600 s. The offset was 0.0 ms at all three points.
- Loudness: integrated −20.6 LUFS, true peak −1.4 dBFS, LRA 8.3 LU, the same as cut-v2.

